uluscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1uIRzK6_z2MehFsBVnJKQQ2eNBL__LwGBOsn1SE2f3yA&oe=69F8B9DE"}, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TZAJ1mcmHrMQ7kNvwFxFa9q&_nc_oc=AdrgDj8xHhLXyLKArp9pdMcrUMNmP4AmsB_T2p0Tgg-Yov9wAFzo2ihklAWr-4iHEPI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2Dt6lkKQM8cSdYAbC6pAA0wnDh2rEdBwiJqsLckZJvNw&oe=69F8A9B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xs-v710cteIQ7kNvwE3R55c&_nc_oc=AdoBp0Pt0aqWLlS7mM0D_48L2ElAOfklruLzBR9Y0Q-CyBkK_CgcXMK-M_s2wh2ztIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2xgNxYc2laFpk4aSbmHaheHxoXdrkXgF4jbJpkvNhuMA&oe=69F8AB4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4JZn1W8r7ugQ7kNvwH6u1jZ&_nc_oc=AdpNM01CB5CeK9Y477ZLKr4D6WSC6j_BmF4soDP-DNlb6PcFvxn-aTegrWKDBXRv_FY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1ovzBxpaVfJDWpN-xD-cCPm_cpt_Kl_SXH2JyBREOWyA&oe=69F8986F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZuhM-o3GDzUQ7kNvwE8UV1W&_nc_oc=AdoEvtHatG6Wfhprfs7aos6ANyq1cnOTjNYL5XkWxNQGxEcSS8N7qoqDzUn6moInUoY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0RPk5Zxuy8rpr2qOMNTXAmMZSA9gh8go79VvtBp7fUQQ&oe=69F8BA03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aojSDe2aeSIQ7kNvwGS4XBd&_nc_oc=AdqWFzGr47rY0_o80h-u5J3NqvvO7sXLDb5h-jKmCQ8Q47Ax_d0zhxz1W9yzAEQvdVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1ZG-G5dK83Fg250mWbwITu8--zJYp7LSXTwzZMay5piQ&oe=69F8B258"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pkrul1cnne4Q7kNvwEJKC2K&_nc_oc=AdpuB-K7hIRCYDFn1KJD7MP9OYCghZkRpAIyeqzsvDZN41c4P9VSxJ4stZCZVYOG0Wg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1